Observe picture beside and tell:

3
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:24,420
Paper strip divided into how many parts?

4
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:30,900
Nga colored how many parts?

5
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:35,820
Linh colored how many parts?

6
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:47,050
Write appropriate fraction corresponding to paper strip part each friend colored.

7
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:57,850
Both friends colored how many paper strip parts?

8
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:12,300
From drawing we know both friends colored five-eighths (paper strip).

9
00:01:13,570 --> 00:01:23,200
To find number of paper strip parts 2 friends colored, we have addition:

10
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:34,370
two-eighths plus three-eighths equals five-eighths.

11
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:49,020
Comment numerator of sum equals sum of two numerators; denominator unchanged.

12
00:01:50,050 --> 00:02:08,300
Conclusion: To add two fractions with same denominator, we add two numerators together, and keep denominator unchanged.

